msgstr "Operatoren"

#: ../../library/ipaddress.rst:425
msgid ""
"Address objects support some operators.  Unless stated otherwise, operators "
"can only be applied between compatible objects (i.e. IPv4 with IPv4, IPv6 "
"with IPv6)."
msgstr ""
"Adressobjekte unterstützen einige Operatoren. Sofern nichts anderes "
"angegeben ist, lassen sich Operatoren nur zwischen zueinander passenden "
"Objekten anwenden, also IPv4 mit IPv4 und IPv6 mit IPv6."

#: ../../library/ipaddress.rst:431
msgid "Comparison operators"
msgstr "Vergleichsoperatoren"

